WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.802 --> 00:00:06.719
1. Open Domains and choose the domain.

2
00:00:06.719 --> 00:00:12.294
2. Scroll to DNS records and open Add a record.

3
00:00:12.294 --> 00:00:22.186
3. Choose the record type, then enter the name and the value.

4
00:00:22.186 --> 00:00:33.520
4. Click Add record. It appears in the list and is usually live within minutes.
